-- spanning TECHNICAL/GENERAL/HSE/SCENARIO/JUDGMENT/PROBLEM_SOLVING/CASE_STUDY, difficulty
-- 1-3, varied stem formats (fact-recall, "which is false", scenario best-action, numeric
-- calculation). Domain grounding: ASME B31.3 (process piping), ASME B31.1, API 686
-- (rotating equipment alignment), pipe wall-thickness (Barlow's formula), flange bolt-up
-- (ASME PCC-1), pressure testing, LOTO/lifting/confined-space HSE.
-- Same rotation technique as supabase/seed/mcq_questions_seed.sql. Idempotent via
-- (job_role, md5(stem_fa)) unique index.

